+/*
+Kit 90 (run 100: memcmp 1.5% of the play, all from here: the whole dlight
+array, 1280 bytes, compared for each of ~110 models a frame). The light
+reads a dlight only when its die is not before the frame's time
+(R_EntityDynamicLight's loop below); one out in both the snapshot and now
+adds nothing either way, so only the others are compared, whole. The time
+itself is compared with the rest.
+*/
+static int RP_PreDlSame( double time )
+{
+	float time_f = RP_TimeCeil( time );
